Description: Allwinner ISP602 camera libraries for A733 and T736
 Allwinner ISP602 userspace libraries, sensor tuning data and public
 headers for the A733 and T736 camera pipeline.
 The ISP algorithm is linked from the upstream ARM64 binary archive.
